abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.7.1 hardens product parity for Labs 13-15 with the mature suite header and toolbar hierarchy, shared theme preference, Share/Embed/settings helpers, complete discovery metadata, state-aware Quick Assign packets, and an open keyboard/text-state/reduced-motion support layer while preserving the v1.7.0 fifteen-lab curriculum, fifteen Quick Assign IDs, learner-response privacy boundary, and all underlying AI mechanisms.
